  "post_title": "Lluna Estilistes celebra sus 10 años durante todo marzo en Onda con nuevas ofertas",
  "post_date": "2013-03-18 14:35:33",
  "post_name": "lluna-estilistes-celebra-sus-10-anos-durante-todo-marzo-en-onda-con-nuevas-ofertas",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Noticias|Sociedad",
  "post_content": "<p>Lluna Estilistes, en la avenida de Catalunya, 36, de Onda celebra este marzo su 10&ordm; aniversario y presenta toda una serie de nuevas ofertas.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/03/LlunaEstilistes10anys.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Durante todo el mes, color+tratamiento+peinado por s&oacute;lo 19,95 &euro;. Para la fotodepilaci&oacute;n se aplica el 50% de descuento. Adem&aacute;s, siguen con la oferta para personas estudiantes y paradas con 2x1. Ana y sus chicas, Bea, Noelia, Gabriela, Carmina y Patri, ofrecieron el martes 12 de marzo tratamientos de keratina gratis a su clientela para celebrar este 10&ordm; aniversario.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/10aniversarillunaestilistes/aniversarilluna1.jpg\" alt=\"aniversarilluna1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/10aniversarillunaestilistes/aniversarilluna10.jpg\" alt=\"aniversarilluna10\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/10aniversarillunaestilistes/aniversarilluna11.jpg\" alt=\"aniversarilluna11\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/10aniversarillunaestilistes/aniversarilluna12.jpg\" alt=\"aniversarilluna12\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/10aniversarillunaestilistes/aniversarilluna13.jpg\" alt=\"aniversarilluna13\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/10aniversarillunaestilistes/aniversarilluna14.jpg\" alt=\"aniversarilluna14\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/10aniversarillunaestilistes/aniversarilluna15.jpg\" alt=\"aniversarilluna15\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/10aniversarillunaestilistes/aniversarilluna2.jpg\" alt=\"aniversarilluna2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/10aniversarillunaestilistes/aniversarilluna3.jpg\" alt=\"aniversarilluna3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/10aniversarillunaestilistes/aniversarilluna4.jpg\" alt=\"aniversarilluna4\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/10aniversarillunaestilistes/aniversarilluna5.jpg\" alt=\"aniversarilluna5\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/10aniversarillunaestilistes/aniversarilluna6.jpg\" alt=\"aniversarilluna6\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/10aniversarillunaestilistes/aniversarilluna7.jpg\" alt=\"aniversarilluna7\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/10aniversarillunaestilistes/aniversarilluna8.jpg\" alt=\"aniversarilluna8\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/10aniversarillunaestilistes/aniversarilluna9.jpg\" alt=\"aniversarilluna9\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/10aniversarillunaestilistes/llunaestilistes10anys.jpg\" alt=\"llunaestilistes10anys\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/10aniversarillunaestilistes/aniversarilluna16.jpg\" alt=\"aniversarilluna16\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/10aniversarillunaestilistes/aniversarilluna17.jpg\"